{"id":"447829","name":"冬瓜山药汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/447829/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"1500g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"200g"},{"name":"山药","amount":"300g"},{"name":"薏米","amount":"20g"},{"name":"猪大骨","amount":"500g"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"3粒"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"薏米泡30分钟。","img":"images/447829/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮切小块。","img":"images/447829/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冬瓜洗净连皮切块。(冬瓜皮清热祛湿。)","img":"images/447829/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪大骨飞水，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/447829/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把胡萝卜，薏米，大骨和蜜枣放入汤锅煮30分钟。","img":"images/447829/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入冬瓜继续煮开后转小火煲1个小时。","img":"images/447829/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"山药去皮切块。","img":"images/447829/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入山药继续煲30分钟。","img":"images/447829/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撇油，放盐调味。","img":"images/447829/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"清热祛湿，健脾养颜。","img":"images/447829/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}